# Build context of the repo-root Dockerfile (host API image). It COPYs only common.props,
# Directory.Packages.props, Dignite.Vault.slnx, NuGet.Config, modules/*/src and src/, and builds
# inside the image, so local build output, npm installs and secrets have no business in the context.
# (angular/Dockerfile.local and etc/docker build from their own context directories; this file does
# not apply to them.)
**/node_modules
**/bin
**/obj
**/dist
**/.angular
**/appsettings.secrets.json
.git
.vs
artifacts
